WEBVTT

00:12:58.507 --> 00:13:00.616
U subotu tokom iste konferencije,

00:13:00.616 --> 00:13:03.660
njen muž me je odveo u stranu,

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.354
i rekao, "Moja žena ne bi mislila

00:13:05.354 --> 00:13:07.789
da sam pravi muškarac da zna ovo,

00:13:07.789 --> 00:13:10.255
ali imam problem sa depresijom

00:13:10.255 --> 00:13:11.609
i uzimam neke lijekove,

00:13:11.609 --> 00:13:14.114
i zanimalo me šta vi mislite?"

00:13:14.114 --> 00:13:15.537
Oni su krili

00:13:15.537 --> 00:13:17.752
isti lijek na različitim mjestima

00:13:17.752 --> 00:13:20.397
u istoj spavaćoj sobi.

00:13:20.397 --> 00:13:22.418
Rekao sam da mislim

00:13:22.418 --> 00:13:24.102
da komunikacija u braku

00:13:24.102 --> 00:13:26.116
možda uzrokuje neke od njihovih problema.

00:13:26.116 --> 00:13:30.307
(Smijeh)